---
import "./homepage-intro.css";
---

<section class="homepage-intro-section">
  <div class="homepage-intro-container">
    <div class="homepage-intro-header">
      <span class="section-badge"> 💜 Built for Anime Fans </span>

      <h2 class="section-title">Discover Anime You'll Actually Love</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="homepage-intro-content">
      <p>
        AniKawa is an anime discovery platform designed to help fans find,
        organize, and enjoy anime more easily. Whether you're looking for the
        latest seasonal releases, timeless classics, hidden gems, or your next
        binge-worthy series, AniKawa brings everything together in one place.
        Explore anime by genre, popularity, recommendations, and curated
        collections created specifically for anime enthusiasts.
      </p>

      <p>
        Unlike traditional anime databases that simply list titles, AniKawa
        focuses on helping viewers decide what to watch next. Many anime pages
        include detailed viewing insights, similar anime recommendations,
        community ratings, standout episodes, fun trivia, and exclusive AniKawa
        Notes. Logged-in users can also create personal watchlists, track
        viewing history, and build their own anime journey. Whether you're new
        to anime or a longtime fan, AniKawa helps you discover anime you'll
        actually love.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
